; One variable: which pages are hidden ahead of the current one in a clipped TabContainer. Godot
; applies each tab_<i>/hidden after the strip first scrolled (tab_bar.cpp:1078-1091), and RIGHT
; alignment reclaims side_margin on overflow (tab_container.cpp:450). T0 to T6 vary hidden pages and
; alignment; R0 to R2 are RIGHT-aligned, overflowing with and without a hidden first page, and fitting.

